/*
  bundles/authorize_phase.spthy -- the AUTHORIZE phase repertoire in one include.
  Producer (the authorization request) + the Attentive/Fearful answers + the SecurityAnxiety
  stressor (Attentive->Fearful). Fearful aborts -- an active refusal (safe-fail).

  Requires a !Session, so pair with protocol/session.spthy and a CALC producer plus
  bundles/human_common.spthy. Adding a new AUTHORIZE stressor = one include line here.
*/

